                                "sense_id": "9cc9ee5f-6890-328b-94e6-647cba4507e9",
                                "text": "I do not think the Constitution should go into working détails or hairsplits that may be necessary when some of the various rights which it defines are rationalized out to their ultimate extrêmes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42c1bce1-9779-4cc5-86a0-642761a660ce",
                                "sense_id": "9cc9ee5f-6890-328b-94e6-647cba4507e9",
                                "text": "It's an arguable distinction, but I think it's a hairsplit."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
